\section{Tissue Manifold Closure}

Tissue geometry is modeled by a metric tensor $g_{ij}(x,t)$.

Closure update:
\[
g_{ij}(t+\Delta t) = g_{ij}(t) +
\lambda_{\text{reg}} \cdot
\big(\Psi_{\text{target}}^{(ij)} - \Psi_{\text{current}}^{(ij)}\big).
\]

Residual error:
\[
\epsilon = \left\| \Psi_{\text{target}}^{(ij)} -
\Psi_{\text{current}}^{(ij)} \right\|.
\]

